<title>USA: Mallinckrodt buys New Jersey lab company.</title>
<headline>Mallinckrodt buys New Jersey lab company.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mallinckrodt Inc said on Wednesday that it acquired D.M. Graham Laboratories Inc, a privatley held contract manufacturer of tablet and capsule pharmaceuticals.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Hobart, New York-based Graham Laboratories has annual sales in the range of $15 million to $20 million, Mallinckrodt said.</p>
<p>Shares of Mallinckrodt, a medical devices and pharmaceuticals company, fell 3/4 to 44-1/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
